WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.880
{IF YOU ARE SEEING THIS, YOUR PLAYER IS NOT RENDERING THE SUBTITLES PROPERLY. PLEASE REFER TO http://saizen-fansubs.com/?section=playback FOR THE INTENDED PLAYBACK.}

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:45.710
"The Memphis Bats: Their pitching and batting has gotten in gear, and they've moved up to second place in the Eastern Division."

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.750
It seems like us being in bad shape at the beginning of the spring wasn't true.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.090
P-Pull over for a second, Gordon!

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.720
P-Pull over for a second, Gordon!

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.020
Hey, Miss!

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:11.060
What are you guys doing? There's a game around the corner!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.070
What do you mean "what"? It's running.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.650
Since we needed to warm up, we thought that maybe we should run.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.190
Warming up already?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.030
Shigeno and Sanders were yelling at us to complete our warm up...

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:24.290
before coming to the stadium so we could do some special fielding training.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.450
Well, we have to hurry, so bye!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.840
I see.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.780
Even though I batted clean-up and was a pitcher in high school,

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.360
all I've done is fetch balls every day since starting university.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.410
It can't be helped. We're still only freshmen after all.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.290
Then what's with him?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.960
All right, Takeuchi.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.330
Step onto the mound.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.000
Yes, sir!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:14.960
He's coming!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.960
Kiyo-kun! Kiyo-kun!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.380
Kiyo-kun! Kiyo-kun!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.090
Takeuchi Kiyoharu.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.260
He has the ability to throw a 150 km/h fastball,

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.470
and was one of the stars of Koshien last year.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.850
He's special.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.230
He's that good after all.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.980
It's not just Takeuchi.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:40.610
Most of the newcomers to the team this year have participated in Koshien.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.410
That's true, but...

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.570
Hey!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.320
Ball boys!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.160
Don't stand there talking!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.740
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.960
Not only next year... even the year after that...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.290
I can't become a regular.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.380
Maybe I should quit?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.150
Hey, Kiyoshi!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.360
You're exerting yourself too much!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.070
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.610
Yeah, that's the spirit!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.410
Komori-kun?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.410
Oh, it really is Komori-kun!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.000
I see.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.590
Since it's you, you'll be aiming to be a starter in university even as a freshman, right?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.260
Y-Yeah, well...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.590
Y-Yeah, well...

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:50.680
B-By the way, those children seem to be at a high level!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.890
You think so?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.730
Yes.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:57.400
That pitcher seems to have good control and a variety of pitches.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.820
If they keep it up, it seems like we can count on your team in the spring tournament.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.150
Oh, I know!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:09.070
This is the former captain of Mifune High School's baseball club, Komori-kun!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.830
He's your great senpai!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.620
I-I'm Komori.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.830
Nice to meet you!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:19.710
He was the famous catcher from the only time Mifune Little defeated Yokohama Little!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:23.710
And now he's joined the baseball club at Japan Education University!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.170
Ed U?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.590
The same place <i>that</i> Takeuchi went to!

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.430
And even as a freshman, he's already become a starter!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.020
C-Coach Ando, what are you...?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.020
Incredible!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:40.360
A Mifune Dolphins' old boy has become such a great player!

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.190
You guys must work hard too!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.480
Yes, sir!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.530
<i>This isn't good...</i>

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.160
<i>I didn't have time to correct him yesterday, but...</i>

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.830
<i>Well, I guess it's for the best if I'm an encouragement to those children.</i>

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.090
We'll cover for you until the bottom of the inning!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.210
Sorry for the inconvenience.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.010
I'm telling you not to worry about it.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:08.880
Driving away the mass media is very...

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.550
Hey, freshmen!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.930
You dropped a ball!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.640
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.220
Hi!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.640
You're the pitcher, Yoshino Shinji-kun, right?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.020
What!?

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.310
Coach Ando strained his back!?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.650
I see.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.480
So practice has been suspended.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.530
And just when the tournament was going to begin soon. It's a pity.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.320
I don't care about the tournament anymore.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.120
What is it?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.240
Look there.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.540
Isn't that our ball boy?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.960
It does matter!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.500
Even if your coach's body has broken down...

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.920
It's not that.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.250
Yo!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.220
Ikegai-senpai and Ooki-senpai!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:34.010
You live around these parts, huh?

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.970
W-Well, yeah.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.270
You're a pitching coach to a child?

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.930
No, not really...

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:44.100
Well, if you just pick up balls all day, I suppose it gets boring.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.730
Ikegai, think a little!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.690
Ending up in that position is something that happens now and then.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.320
I shouldn't have said that!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.530
Do your best to be a good coach for him!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.370
And teach him some tricks for fetching balls too!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.290
"Fetching balls"...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.040
It was a lie that you were a starter then?

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.040
Y-Yeah...

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.460
But it wasn't my intention to deceive you guys!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:09.840
Shinji-kun!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.220
Oh my, what a pathetic state I'm in.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:21.020
Don't you know anyone who can fill in as the coach?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.810
Even if I try to find one, no one would be able to so quickly.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.530
There's someone right here!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.070
M-Me?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.080
M-Me?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.080
It doesn't matter if you win or lose.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.500
Please teach them the importance of doing your very best in a game.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.710
If it's you, Komori-kun, I'm sure you can do it!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.460
C-Coach Ando...

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:52.840
Having fought to the bitter end together with Shigeno- no, Honda Goro, you can definitely do it!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.600
I understand. It's only during the weekend anyway.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.520
I accept the job as the substitute coach.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.480
Um...

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:18.320
U-Until Coach Ando's body gets better, I-I'll be your substitute coach.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.280
U-Um...

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.240
That's how it is, so let's get along.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.370
Let's get along!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.750
Then we'll start with...

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.000
everyone pairing up and stretching.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.040
Yes, sir!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.300
Coach!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.380
Hey, Coach!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.550
What, are you talking to me?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.470
Next time, can you get Takeuchi's autograph?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.600
I'm sorry. That's not allowed.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.520
But you're both starters and buddies!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.860
So that's why you should get it stealthily!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.020
Katsuyoshi!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.860
Stop talking about stupid things and come over here!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.690
Sorry, sorry.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>As I thought, this team is quite good!</i>

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.500
Okay, next!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.830
Um... Coach?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.670
What is it, Kiyoshi-kun?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.840
It's about time to go home.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.670
Huh, already?

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:24.720
H-Hey, you guys! There's still time left, so let's practice a little more.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:28.440
But we haven't told our parents that we'll be late, and also...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.440
Even if we practice now, it's pointless.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.730
Yeah.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:37.150
Shinji-kun, I'd like to extend the practice time next weekend a little.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:39.820
I don't think anyone wants to do that.

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:41.950
The tournament starts the week after next!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.240
Even if it's only a little each time, we have to pratice a lot, or we won't have a chance!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:47.040
Hey, Coach, haven't you heard?

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.000
Our first opponent is Yokohama Little.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.920
Yokohama Little?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.250
Since we can't win anyway,

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.210
there's no point in exerting ourselves with training.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.840
It's true that they are strong, but...

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:02.390
it's not good to decide that you'll lose before even playing!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:15.400
Before their opponent was decided, they were improving and continued practicing until it got dark.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.570
I see.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:21.950
I was enthusiastic the other day and forgot about this essential matter.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.530
I'm sorry- ah, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:29.120
No, even if I'm just a substitute, I'm the coach right now.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.660
I'll do everything in my power...

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.000
to draw forth their fighting spirit!

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.840
<i>I said that to Coach Ando, but...</i>

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:47.180
<i>what would Honda-kun do in this situation?</i>

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.940
This is a free fansub.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.940
Not for sale or rent.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.820
In the game before we played Yokohama Little,

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.860
I, the catcher, hurt my hand.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.370
You hurt your hand?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.080
Didn't you have a back-up?

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.870
At that time, there were only nine people on the Mifune Dolphins.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.710
Nine people!? That's too few.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.670
That's horrible!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.420
Do you know how such a team defeated Yokohama Little?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.180
Even in that kind of situation, we all did our best and practiced together.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.720
Believing that we could really win!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:39.230
If we compare how we were to you guys,
you'll be able to fight on par even with Yokohama Little.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.230
I-Is that really so?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.610
I-Is that really so?

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.950
Yeah, I guarantee it!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.950
H-Hey, maybe we should try our best?

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.620
That's right, let's work hard!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.450
It's an Ed U starter that's telling us this, after all.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.040
Yeah.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.830
A-Anyway, we'll extend today's practice.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.630
Is that okay?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.000
It's useless.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.460
Shinji-kun, what are you saying?

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:06.010
You practiced on your own even when there wasn't a coach, after all.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.300
In reality, you really want to win the game, don't you?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.350
With your skill, you're good enough to be on Yokohama Little!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:16.230
You think I can trust the words of a lying coach!?

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.900
What did he mean by liar?

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:18.900
Dunno.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.610
What do you mean by liar, Shinji?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.610
Why don't you ask the coach?

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.740
Geez, what's this?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.120
I believed him since he said he was a starter, and then I found out that he's just a ball boy!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.870
I bragged about him to my mother too!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.300
I'm sorry!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.470
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.430
Yo, it's been a while.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.310
How've you been?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.980
I met Yamane-kun here by chance.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:14:00.150
While we two were talking, we thought why not invite everyone over here.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.780
In the end, none of us could keep away from baseball.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.030
Well, Oobayashi and I joined our university's club.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:14.330
Him and I are on our company's grass-lot ball club though.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.660
And Komorin's on Ed U's baseball club.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:18.960
You're great!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.250
No...

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.460
Someone like me...

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:26.920
Wait, me too, I'm so great that I'm known as the team's secret weapon.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:31.550
In your case, you're not a secret weapon for the game, but for when it gets rough.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.560
Yeah, yeah, for when it gets rough...

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.520
You prick!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.520
Komori...

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:44.570
Frankly, I was able to do my very best because you were always there doing your best.{ /because I was always seeing you doing your best.}

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:49.110
Even now, I still remember every single pitch...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.030
with you in the game against Honda.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.910
I'm really thankful to you!

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.580
Komori?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.710
I've remembered something I need to do!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.960
H-Hey!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.760
<i>I can't get depressed from something like that!</i>

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.180
<i>I've got to work hard!</i>

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.970
<i>For those children-</i>

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:15.890
<i>No,</i>

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>for my sake too!</i>

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.480
<i>Let's start!</i>

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.490
Ooki, what's the matter?

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.450
No, it's nothing.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.520
Coach!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:07.570
Komori...

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:08.820
I-I have a request.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.530
I-I have a request.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.830
What's that guy thinking?

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.040
Maybe he thinks he's something due to being a Little League coach?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.210
<i>I-I have a request.</i>

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.670
<i>I-I have a request.</i>

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:31.970
<i>I-In the next practice game, please use me!</i>

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.930
<i>I-In the next practice game, please use me!</i>

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.060
<i>Can you hit Takeuchi's ball?</i>

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.700
<i>If you can do that, it's not impossible that I'll consider using you as a pinch-hitter.</i>

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.690
<i>I'll do it!</i>

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:49.190
<i>I'll definitely hit it!</i>

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.410
<i>It's fast!</i>

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.160
<i>But...</i>

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.160
<i>it isn't a pitch that I can't hit!</i>

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.310
Everyone!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.980
Tomorrow my university is holding a practice game.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.150
If you've got time, I'd like you to come and watch.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.740
Even though he won't play himself,
why is he telling us to "come and watch"?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.700
Shinji, what should we do?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.410
Let's just go and check it out.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.620
Are you serious?

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.630
Takeuchi might be playing.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.830
Oh, I see!

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.460
Then there's a point in going.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.840
Takeuchi!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.090
Kiyo-kun!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.930
It's totally a pitcher's duel.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.600
Takeuchi is amazing, but the opponent's pitcher isn't losing either.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.270
<i>Two outs, with a runner on second and third, and they're in the lower part of their lineup.{at the lower order of our batting lineup.}</i>

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.360
<i>This is a chance for a pinch-hitter.</i>

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.360
Komori.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.570
Yes, sir!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.530
H-Hey!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.530
H-Hey!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:20.280
Yeah.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:28.620
Play!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.170
Strike!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.750
Fast!

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:37.550
Damn, he can't hit that!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.130
<i>Coach...</i>

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.470
<i>If there is anything I can teach you guys,</i>

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.850
<i>it's this!</i>

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.620
Safe! Safe!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:06.290
He did it!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.790
Timely double!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.250
You did it!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.570
Well done!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.380
Next week is the game!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.760
Let's do our best!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.470
Yeah!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.050
Let's go!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.140
Continue like that!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:24.720
Okay!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.390
Shinji-kun.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.520
Time for the final pitching practice.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.140
Y-Yes, sir!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:31.940
Y-Yes, sir!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.020
Okay, come!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.030
<i>Here I go!</i>

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.630
Strike! Batter out!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.640
Change!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.810
Nice pitching! Good going, Shinji!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:07.760
All right!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.360
Out!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.030
Okay!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.950
We're counting on you, Shinji!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.410
Stay cool!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.210
<i>The coach... worked so hard.</i>

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:33.620
<i>I have to work hard too!</i>

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.930
Safe! Safe!

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:52.100
You did it! A triple!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.180
Kiyoshi-kun.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.320
Safe!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.990
Good job! We scored the first run!

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:07.780
Coach, we scored the first run against Yokohama Little!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.490
Yeah.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:14.790
<i>That's...</i>

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.840
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.880
<i>He was on the team the same time Honda was.</i>

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.920
<i>Letting down your guard is taboo, huh?</i>

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.340
Chief umpire, we're changing pitchers.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:31.310
They're already putting in their ace!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.270
It's all right!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:33.480
Go with your chests out!

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:34.730
Y-Yes!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:35.440
Y-Yes!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:48.450
Bow!

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.160
Thank you very much!

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.830
A brutal loss!

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.080
Damn it!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.000
You've all done your best.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.500
It's okay to cry.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.290
If you're ashamed, you'll be able to win for sure next time.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:05.300
Even though the coach worked so hard for us, we couldn't...

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.010
Coach?

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:11.100
Even the coach is crying!

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:14.810
But it's not because I'm ashamed.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.980
That one run is like a treasure from all of you.

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:20.940
I'm really grateful!

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:26.650
You're thanking us even though we lost? You really are a strange coach.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:31.700
<i>Honda-kun...</i>

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>I am going to work as hard as these children too!</i>

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.080
<i>And then...</i>

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:39.330
<i>one day...</i>

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.930
The Bats and I are in great shape!{AMS: perfect condition}

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.890
During this time, a new catcher joins the team.

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:16.510
Huh?

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:18.180
A catcher!?

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.850
Hey, what are you going to do, old man Sanders?

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:23.100
A rival has appeared, right?

00:24:23.100 --> 00:24:24.100
Next time, on Major:

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:25.060
A Stupid Bet.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:27.820
Run to the stage of your dreams!
